    "q-134037": {
      "dom_id": "question-134037",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "If $8$ people made all the muffins for the sale, and each made the same number of muffins, then each person made\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \nmuffins.",
      "worked_solution": "We know that there are $336$ muffins in total. So, each person made $336÷8$ muffins.\n\nWe start by writing down the question using long division notation:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{3\\,\\phantom{|}3\\,\\phantom{|}6}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></td>\n<td width=\"250\" align=\"left\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nNotice that $3$ (the number of hundreds in $336$) is less than the divisor $8.$ Therefore, we should consider both the hundreds and tens:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{3\\,\\phantom{|}3\\,\\phantom{|}6}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$↓$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></td>\n<td width=\"250\" align=\"left\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Divide: $33÷8=4\\,\\text{R}\\,1$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Write over tens: $4$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Multiply: $8\\times 4=32$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Subtract: $33-32=1$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Bring down: $6$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nNext, we consider the ones:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{3\\,\\phantom{|}3\\,\\phantom{|}6}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\boxed{\\text{0}}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></td>\n<td width=\"250\" align=\"left\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Divide: $16÷8=2$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Write over ones: $2$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Multiply: $8\\times 2=16$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\"> \n<td>Subtract: $16-16=0$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nWe get the remainder $0$, so the division is done.\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n336÷8=42.\n$$",
